{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49026","headline":"五言赠诸法师 · 公孙杲","name":"五言赠诸法师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驾鹤排朱雾，乘鸾入紫烟。\n凌晨味潭菊，薄暮翫峰莲。\n玉叶低梁下，金飀引窗前。\n啸傲云霞际，留情鳞羽年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"公孙杲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49026.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49026","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}